  "description": "We have done it again, making our own E-Bike segment: High performance, full suspension fat bike. The new Trailblazer AT is not only light weight but offers massive 4.8\" tires, an all new motor system, insane 160mm of travel all wrapped in a light weight package. The Trailblazer AT is literally in a class of its own!\n\nWe LOVE fat bikes and everything they offer. They are more stable, have better traction, and have the ability to traverse terrain your standard bike would never imagine. This is why we designed the Trailblazer AT. There is literally NOTHING on the market quite like it and it shares the same performance pedigree as the Trailblazer, with some exciting changes.\n\nImagine having fat e-bike bike with up to 2X the power and torque of any of the mainstream big box brands, a massive 1050Wh 52V USA made battery pack, 160mm of travel, and massive 4.8\" tires to float over anything from sand to snow. Well, dream no more, the wait is finally over!\n\nWhen we say All Terrain, WE MEAN IT! Taking cues from the Trailblazer, we designed the Trailblazer AT for the rigors of hardcore off road riding. Whether you want to hit the single track, your bike park, or just explore uncharted terrain, the Trailblazer AT is your ticket.\n\nWelcome to the next generation of E-Biking!",
